* LM267x switching model for ngspice, built from TI's LM2678 PSpice transient
* model (SNVM880, WEBENCH 2012): same error amplifier and internal
* compensation (GM1, Vin-dependent GM2 table, R3/R4/L1, R5/C1/C6/R10, output
* clamps 0.9V..5V, gain 0.8), same RC oscillator (RT 100k / CT 39.9p charging
* to 5V, ramp 0.6 -> 3.2V, 0.225us discharge = forced off time, ~263 kHz) and
* switch Rds(on).  Differences: the switch is a smooth conductance (tanh)
* instead of the gate-driven FET; the forced-off time is set to the
* datasheet's 91% maximum duty; the cycle-by-cycle current limit is a smooth
* clamp at ILIM (no latch, no duty fold-back): peak currents at the limit are
* right, the dissipation during a limit event is not; undervoltage lockout at
* VIN 7.9V as in TI's model.
* Params: GM1 (12V 1.54m, 5V 0.673m, ADJ 0.673m), RFB2/RFB1 (internal divider, 2.5k bottom;
* ADJ: RFB2 ~0 and RFB1 ~open, the external divider sets the output),
* RON (LM2678 0.12, LM2676 0.15), ILIM (typ: LM2678 7A, LM2676 4.5A).
.subckt LM267X_SW vin fb sw gnd PARAMS: GM1=1.54m RFB2=22.19k RFB1=2.5k RON=0.12 ILIM=7 TOFF=0.34u
.param TCH={100k*39.9p*ln((5-0.6)/(5-3.2))}
.param TPER={TOFF + TCH}
Vref refv gnd 1.215
Rfb2 fb ea1 {RFB2}
Rfb1 ea1 gnd {RFB1}
Gm1 gnd n15 ea1 refv {GM1}
Bgm2 gnd n17 I = v(refv,n15) * v(gm2)
Bgm2v gm2 gnd V = max(0.48m, min(1.48m, v(vin,gnd) < 10 ? 1.48m : (v(vin,gnd) < 20 ? 1.48m - (v(vin,gnd)-10)*0.0807m : 0.673m - (v(vin,gnd)-20)*0.00965m)))
R3 refv n16 10k
R4 n15 n16 2k
L1 n16 refv 20m
R5 n17 n18 15k
C1 n18 gnd 10n
C6 n17 n18 105p
R10 n17 gnd 300k
D1 n17 r5v DCL
D2 vcl n17 DCL
Vr5 r5v gnd 5
Vcl vcl gnd 0.9
.model DCL D
Berr err gnd V = 0.8*v(n17,gnd)
* oscillator ramp: forced high during the 0.225us discharge, then RC from 0.6V
Bramp ramp gnd V = (time - floor(time/TPER)*TPER) < TOFF ? 5 : 5 - 4.4*exp(-((time - floor(time/TPER)*TPER) - TOFF)/(100k*39.9p))
Ben en gnd V = 0.5*(1 + tanh((v(vin,gnd) - 7.9)/0.1))
* switch on while ramp < error output, clamped at ILIM, off below UVLO
Vsns vin vins 0
* switch current sensed through a 20 ns filter (no algebraic loop in the clamp)
Fsns gnd isn Vsns 1
Risn isn gnd 1
Cisn isn gnd 20n
Bsw vins sw I = v(vins,sw) * (0.5/RON) * (1 + tanh((v(err,gnd) - v(ramp,gnd))/5m)) * v(en,gnd) * 0.5*(1 + tanh((ILIM - v(isn,gnd))/0.1))
Csw sw gnd 300p
.ends LM267X_SW

* same core with the ON/OFF pin (enabled above 1.4V, TI threshold)
.subckt LM267X_SWEN vin fb sw gnd onoff PARAMS: GM1=1.54m RFB2=22.19k RFB1=2.5k RON=0.12 ILIM=7 TOFF=0.34u
.param TCH={100k*39.9p*ln((5-0.6)/(5-3.2))}
.param TPER={TOFF + TCH}
Vref refv gnd 1.215
Rfb2 fb ea1 {RFB2}
Rfb1 ea1 gnd {RFB1}
Gm1 gnd n15 ea1 refv {GM1}
Bgm2 gnd n17 I = v(refv,n15) * v(gm2)
Bgm2v gm2 gnd V = max(0.48m, min(1.48m, v(vin,gnd) < 10 ? 1.48m : (v(vin,gnd) < 20 ? 1.48m - (v(vin,gnd)-10)*0.0807m : 0.673m - (v(vin,gnd)-20)*0.00965m)))
R3 refv n16 10k
R4 n15 n16 2k
L1 n16 refv 20m
R5 n17 n18 15k
C1 n18 gnd 10n
C6 n17 n18 105p
R10 n17 gnd 300k
D1 n17 r5v DCL
D2 vcl n17 DCL
Vr5 r5v gnd 5
Vcl vcl gnd 0.9
.model DCL D
Berr err gnd V = 0.8*v(n17,gnd)
* disabled: TI's SS node is held low, so the duty starts from zero at enable
Bss ssn gnd V = v(en,gnd) > 0.5 ? 1 : 0
* oscillator ramp: forced high during the 0.225us discharge, then RC from 0.6V
Bramp ramp gnd V = (time - floor(time/TPER)*TPER) < TOFF ? 5 : 5 - 4.4*exp(-((time - floor(time/TPER)*TPER) - TOFF)/(100k*39.9p))
Ben en gnd V = 0.5*(1 + tanh((v(vin,gnd) - 7.9)/0.1)) * 0.5*(1 + tanh((v(onoff,gnd) - 1.4)/0.05))
* switch on while ramp < error output, clamped at ILIM, off below UVLO
Vsns vin vins 0
* switch current sensed through a 20 ns filter (no algebraic loop in the clamp)
Fsns gnd isn Vsns 1
Risn isn gnd 1
Cisn isn gnd 20n
Bsw vins sw I = v(vins,sw) * (0.5/RON) * (1 + tanh((v(err,gnd) - v(ramp,gnd))/5m)) * v(en,gnd) * 0.5*(1 + tanh((ILIM - v(isn,gnd))/0.1))
Csw sw gnd 300p
.ends LM267X_SWEN
